{"data":[{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1772630233327292592","created_at":"2024-03-26T14:22:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1772630233327292592"],"id":"1772630233327292592","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":286,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"人生就是这样的啦！对的时机遇到错的人，错的时机遇到有趣的人。以前的我压抑和封闭，现在我可是钮钴禄·66，接受机会才能享受到未知的可能。","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1772630233327292592"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1772627286165995893","created_at":"2024-03-26T14:10:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1772627286165995893"],"id":"1772627286165995893","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":288,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我真的神经，收到了新美瞳晚上没洗头没洗脸化了个妆臭美，但是感觉新美瞳不是很适合我。还是乖一点色彩少一点的妆好看","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1772627286165995893"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1772613267434643869","created_at":"2024-03-26T13:15:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1772613267434643869"],"id":"1772613267434643869","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":296,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"祸从口出还是蛮可怕的，还是少说话多做事吧🙀🙀🙀🙀🙀","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1772613267434643869"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1772289142384161171","created_at":"2024-03-25T15:47:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1772289142384161171"],"id":"1772289142384161171","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":303,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"再这样下去不得了，还是克制一下自己，祸从口出啊！！！！","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1772289142384161171"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1772287915709579673","created_at":"2024-03-25T15:42:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1772287915709579673"],"id":"1772287915709579673","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":233,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"把你们性生活全部偷走，我偷偷偷偷偷偷偷偷偷偷偷","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1772287915709579673"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1772287005596029153","created_at":"2024-03-25T15:38:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1772287005596029153"],"id":"1772287005596029153","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":239,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我本来就是一个很好的人，加上我是一个看感觉的人！","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1772287005596029153"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1772270738130510018","created_at":"2024-03-25T14:34:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1772270738130510018"],"id":"1772270738130510018","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":351,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我简直是doi圣体，什么时候人可以绝育啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1772270738130510018"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1772265128324677678","created_at":"2024-03-25T14:11:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1772265128324677678"],"id":"1772265128324677678","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":239,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"想减肥又没动力去减肥，总想着拖延拖延，不过真的要去健身房考察一下才好，人还是要动起来才有精气神","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1772265128324677678"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1772264962901385464","created_at":"2024-03-25T14:11:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1772264962901385464"],"id":"1772264962901385464","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":232,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近没什么好发的，拿了意想不到大学的offer，从此有了甜蜜的烦恼，开始盘算项目的规划开始每天琢磨宿舍的申请。原来我也有甜蜜的负担","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1772264962901385464"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1772264741861282217","created_at":"2024-03-25T14:10:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1772264741861282217"],"id":"1772264741861282217","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":289,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我要改个名字，要不然要被室友发现了","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1772264741861282217"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1771923042945618311","created_at":"2024-03-24T15:32:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1771923042945618311"],"id":"1771923042945618311","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":316,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"排卵期真的很可怕，，，，，","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1771923042945618311"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1771191248923087328","created_at":"2024-03-22T15:04:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1771191248923087328"],"id":"1771191248923087328","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":287,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我简直活成了爽文女主的感觉。小时候称王称霸，青少年时期被尘土掩埋，大学蓄力奋力一搏。年少时因为学习经历导致“自卑”，最终会在阶段性的成就面前粉碎，从而重建更有自信的自己。","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1771191248923087328"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1771190551418659254","created_at":"2024-03-22T15:01:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1771190551418659254"],"id":"1771190551418659254","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":274,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近现充真的很满足，收到了特别多的好消息。感觉又回到了还没变成毒妇的时候🥰🥰","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1771190551418659254"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1771013101732905441","created_at":"2024-03-22T03:16:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1771013101732905441"],"id":"1771013101732905441","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":343,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我首先承认我是一个很倒霉的人，中考发烧高考失利。其次我承认我是一个很有潜力的人，想做的事尽全力去做，偶尔会偷懒但是能找到适合自己的方法。最后我承认我是一个幸运的人，每一步脚印都算数。","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1771013101732905441"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1770837629501681736","created_at":"2024-03-21T15:39:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1770837629501681736"],"id":"1770837629501681736","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":270,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"兄弟姐妹们！罢免久坐！我的腰好痛啊啊啊啊","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1770837629501681736"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1770743934991356400","created_at":"2024-03-21T09:27:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1770743934991356400"],"id":"1770743934991356400","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":258,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"耳洞经常不带耳钉是真的会长起来的！今天把耳洞通开了啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊有点痛但是好在是通开了","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1770743934991356400"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1770672937445802151","created_at":"2024-03-21T04:45:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1770672937445802151"],"id":"1770672937445802151","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":390,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"凡事都要留一手才行。回家的时候把睡衣睡裤全带回去了，以为来学校不会冷，结果就是降温根本没衣服穿，就一条厚一点的秋裤和一件薄秋衣，我甚至连袜子都没带.......小姐姐真是心大","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1770672937445802151"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1770672624957546740","created_at":"2024-03-21T04:43:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1770672624957546740"],"id":"1770672624957546740","lang":"ja","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":220,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我我要吃小番茄我要吃小番茄我要吃小番茄","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1770672624957546740"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1770672191614722359","created_at":"2024-03-21T04:42:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1770672191614722359"],"id":"1770672191614722359","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":205,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"谁能想到我是鼻黏膜受损了！就是说为什么鼻子一直好不了一直都很干燥而且敏感，原来是鼻黏膜受损。","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1770672191614722359"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1770670512936730634","created_at":"2024-03-21T04:35:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1770670512936730634"],"id":"1770670512936730634","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":202,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"为什么学校的沙县没有鸡蛋是烤肠！！！！为什么没有鸡蛋！！！！烤肠好难吃🤢","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1770670512936730634"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1770661435892469776","created_at":"2024-03-21T03:59:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1770661435892469776"],"id":"1770661435892469776","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":285,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"来学校做饭也是别有一番滋味","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1770661435892469776"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1770423538736115832","created_at":"2024-03-20T12:13:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1770423538736115832"],"id":"1770423538736115832","in_reply_to_user_id":"1385266966970060804","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":39,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"@tysj_yume @cctpdre 好朋友是最好的解药！黑子说话！","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1770423538736115832"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1770423146212196646","created_at":"2024-03-20T12:12:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1770423146212196646"],"id":"1770423146212196646","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":253,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"四季牌阵看了，感觉接下来除了花钱，所有的事情都在我的掌控之中。很好很好，已经很久没看到这么松弛的自己了！","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1770423146212196646"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1770422838459326613","created_at":"2024-03-20T12:11:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1770422838459326613"],"id":"1770422838459326613","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":303,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"昨天把前男友送的香片扔掉了，抱枕还可以靠着就先不扔了。断舍离总是在一些莫名其妙的时候，之前舍不得扔，总感觉没有香味还有东西在。其实味道早在那个夏天就消散了，人也早就不在乎了。不过对于有点收集癖的我而言，每个物品都有纪念的意义，但是也不是事事都要纪念嘟！","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1770422838459326613"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1770421039509786698","created_at":"2024-03-20T12:04:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1770421039509786698"],"id":"1770421039509786698","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":227,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"学校的硬板床睡起来好不习惯，我要睡家里柔软的大床！！！！但是小床好有安全感，我喜欢我的花花被子和枕头和小狗！","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1770421039509786698"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1518626636476092417","name":"小猫抓","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1881504833448091648/ZFRN2Ag7_normal.jpg","username":"Six_One61_","verified":false},{"id":"1385266966970060804","name":"淺夢","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1589884642421002240/L3ezacCt_normal.jpg","username":"tysj_yume","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"1772630233327292592","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3fr5wcbo0w9j73frv9pmovrl59g2kcd","oldest_id":"1770421039509786698","result_count":25}}